{"server":"cn","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_09_beg","groupId":"act40side","stageId":"act40side_09","title":"长寿面","storyCode":"OR-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act40side/level_act40side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"cde53e2796a360aaeb1b90514779c360d8fdc1efb30588bea43cd81df5d36c1f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"岁兽一事终于还是到了最后的关头。玉门城楼上，梁洵面对太傅坦白了自己在事件中的行动。在城外古寺，两位许久不见的代理人重新聚首。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"30_ex1_snowmount"},{"type":"narration","text":"离维多利亚已经不远了......\n又下雪了......她们应该已经换上冬衣了吧。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"小时候就像个小火炉，一腔热血，想来是不怕这样一点风雪的。\n百灶没有这样冷的冬天，她说等开春的时候，第一卷书应该已经写成了。\n如此就好......\n浮生至此，了无挂怀。\n男人脱下官服，仔细折叠整齐，和随身带的书籍放在一处，向东边的方向再三拜首。\n他走出了营地。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的火的确变得更烫了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感染者，你的源石技艺对自己身体的消耗很大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"开始怕热了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，这不过是我一个人的血......我清楚，我之所以还能站在这里，是因为已经有太多人流过血。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来你已经知道了很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算不上很多，但最重要的是，我只要知道一件事就够了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那些被掩盖掉姓名的人，那些死得不明不白的人......都不能就这样算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说真的，我从来没有想过自己的身世还会牵扯出这么复杂的故事，也没有想过自己还有为感染者而战之外的使命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我想明白了，道理是一样的。我的血，是为制止我看到的一切不公义的事情而流的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以血引火......感染者，你倒有几分古时义士之风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但现在你一叶障目，最好不要轻易谈什么公正。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"无论如何，我受命要将你带回，断不可再放走你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，我知道......我见过你这种人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许不能简单地说你们是坏人，你们只是被训练成这副无血无泪的样子......所以别人的血和泪，你们也不在乎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有关系，我不会和你讲什么道理——你大可以试着拦住我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽是贼寇乱党......勇气可嘉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当心点，我会留你一命，但未必能保你四肢健全。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"纵贯白雷正法，破！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"avg_1040_blaze2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你有很多话想说，但是当务之急只有一件。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是要去见真龙吗，我来帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟青砚？你应该在狱中！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我现在站在你面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手下败将，你输给过我一次。这一次，你们两个，都别想走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，我也没有打算和你单挑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说是我提议要来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可招惹到的这个对手......不好对付啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有同伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是你将她从大狱中带出来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用了点粗暴手段，但尽可能避免伤及无辜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"债多了不愁，我有那么多罪责难逃，也不差这一桩。等这边事了，我投案服法便是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"解真","speakerId":"avg_npc_1618_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是当下，该办的事，该见的人，都需要一个结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"肃政院御史，大理寺少卿，协同犯上作乱......我从未见过如此荒唐的场面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"既然已经足够荒唐，那便再算我一个吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小教头，别来无恙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合？！你不是在玉门受了重伤——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是......伤得有点重了。身上这点功夫，还有没有原来三成都不好说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以今天，还是希望尽可能不要动手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"为什么，连你也要参与进来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麟少卿来得突然，我还来不及了解事情全貌。但二位都是我最敬佩的同僚，我也只能以故友身份，劝二位留一丝和谈的余地。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们执意要做这般大逆不道之事，还指望我视若不见吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“取忠舍义”......但谁说，这二者只能选其一呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公义......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"这桩罪案你已知晓，涉事的两人就在你眼前。\n孰是孰非，孰生孰死，选择在你。\n可是师父......这件事缘由复杂，善恶岂能轻易——\n剑在你手中，做出选择！\n师父......！\n还不动手？！\n师父，如果公义只能在剑锋之上得到伸张，那“公义”与“暴力”何异？\n我不明白......"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g7_forbiddencity"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"麟青砚","speakerId":"avg_npc_1644_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要逗留，快进去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"休想——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是，禁城撤防的信号......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“禁军小教头”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1615_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下......难道？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从这里看过去，都已经能看到禁城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一次站在这城楼上的时候，还是春天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......这半年着实发生了不少事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天气已经凉了，城头风大。太傅注意身体。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"朝堂诸公，想来是没有几个人从这个角度看过百灶的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"登高望远，也总有浮云遮目，不见得总能看得清的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......行事当思进退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道，我当初让你来担任玉门参知是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"私以为，是太傅想让在下开拓眼界，见识大局。是给在下的机会，也是考验。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"于何事的考验？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是否堪当大用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那你知道，今天我叫你来是何意？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是太傅，对在下失望了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是推脱堂皇之词，还是当真作此想？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下清楚，先前百珍宴之举，是下下之策。可是也别无他法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......迫使百珍宴中断，不给太尉先斩后奏、倒逼真龙的机会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自从你卷入这一系列纷争中，三次陷入抉择，而每次都是行最险的棋。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你将你的朋友，连带你自己，一同放在这棋盘上......你就从来没有犹豫过？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下不敢说毫无私情......可再三权衡，唯有顾全大局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算得上能谋，但不可谓善断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本想挑选一位有抱负而无贪欲，有手腕而无私心的年轻才干，多给些历练的机会。如有可能，便可以大事相托。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我原本以为，你是一个合适的人选......可执棋者以身作子，大多是不得善终的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你让我想起一位同僚......已经是位故去之人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下惭愧......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......梁洵，如果再给你一次机会选择，你可还愿意离开尚蜀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下在求学之初，立志要让毕生所学为天下人所用。至于身居何位，不过是机遇使然......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下初心不曾变过，也不会为做过的选择后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百珍宴的意外，需要一个说法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下甘愿服法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天镜阁的藏书楼缺一位誊录郎，明天起你就去那里任职吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......多谢太傅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......终于是要到了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"云积得很厚，遮住了圆月清光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅曾见过那个人......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不曾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这局棋上，他求的对手，究竟是谁呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有时棋局上，所求的并非与对手的输赢，而是一个解法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......在无数变化中，寻求一个双方都可接受的两全之解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下想要请教太傅......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您当初，是为何决定，要设下那一场大考？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g1_yusrestaurant"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"店家，还没打烊吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赶得真巧，做完你这单生意就打烊了。不过时候确实晚了，店里剩的吃的也不多了。要点什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不挑，随便买点能路上充饥的就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那正好这里还剩半笼肉包子，早上做的，也不要钱了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么做生意，那不就成了亏本买卖？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，我本来就只会做饭，不太会做生意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这么好的手艺，就不想靠它挣些名利？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么用呢？王侯贵胄，贩夫走卒，谁不都还是吃一日三餐。挣什么名利，还不如蒸包子有意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多嘴一问，平时百姓来这里吃一餐饭要多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不贵不贵，最平常的两菜一汤，几块钱就能打发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要是能在百灶有份活计，就能在这家饭馆里吃饱饭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来店家竟然有颗济世仁心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别别，您可别这么说我......我就只是一介厨师，每天能招待的客人，撑死也不过百来号人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要想让全天下人都衣食无忧，那只能靠您多费心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"白吃你一顿包子，还能听到一个教训......不亏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，我平时就喜欢和客人聊天，东拉西扯的，说话也没个边儿，您别生我的气就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没记错的话，这家店开了也挺长一段时间了，盈亏如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......这可就头疼了。您看，我这小店一年到头，也就勉强回本。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是今年大荒城粮产缺了些，或者驰道不通，货物运输慢了些，我这小饭馆成本高了，这里的人也就吃不到这个价格的饭了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你这是在替其他几位邀功？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈......可是账还没算完呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"来这吃饭的都是街坊邻居，有人吃完饭赊了一点饭钱，要么送我几大箱新鲜水果，要么包圆了屋里的家具维修......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是没了他们关照，这家小饭馆还是开不下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以说，这笔账实在不好算呀......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"做生意不就是这样，谁说一定要你死我活呢？有来有往，和气生财，生意才能做得长久嘛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"小大厨","speakerId":"avg_2026_yu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅大人，半笼包子，给您装好了。您要不先尝尝？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......味道是不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别学那个做生意的说话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"大人，您买完饭了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，听说这家包子的味道是百灶一绝，分你一个尝尝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔......嗯......好吃，真好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"车夫","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"行，吃点东西也有劲赶路了。咱们去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......尚蜀。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......怎么走的来着？\n城东七街五坊，我记得要路过一家染坊，一家瓷窑......\n嗐，都晕了头，好多年没来过了，早就不知道变成什么——哦？这家字画店竟然还在？上面这块招牌都要变成文物了吧......\n改天可以来逛逛，说不定能找到——唉，应该还是找不到的吧。\n唔，好像快到了......\n这座古寺还是一点没变，这些年没人来过，竟然也没拆......到底是谁念旧呢？\n......锁已经打开了？\n呀，你已经回来了。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
